{"3724820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DATA BREACH", "steam_appid": 3724820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DATA BREACH</strong> is corporate horror for 1-4 expendable robots. <strong>Valkyron</strong> leases your mind, rents you a chassis, and sends you into long abandoned facilities to recover the data that keeps its cities running. Hit today's quota and you've earned another shift. Miss it, and the whole crew gets <strong>recycled</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/44a5d8d0a1475bfac45daeb9f8da8bb5.avif?t=1784800094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras_big/44a5d8d0a1475bfac45daeb9f8da8bb5.webp?t=1784800094 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick together, cover each other, and make the train.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/3b2f26d4496a1340b8287373758253df.poster.avif?t=1784800094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/3b2f26d4496a1340b8287373758253df.webm?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/3b2f26d4496a1340b8287373758253df.mp4?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/ad1066a7f103bdea11e5e4e02f498433.avif?t=1784800094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras_big/ad1066a7f103bdea11e5e4e02f498433.webp?t=1784800094 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph what's hunting you to clear your daily agenda and fill a bestiary of their names, tells, and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/263fe64fe9ea934defeeeeb08508593e.poster.avif?t=1784800094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/263fe64fe9ea934defeeeeb08508593e.webm?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/263fe64fe9ea934defeeeeb08508593e.mp4?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/a7dc6fc3608d53fdf8ed0d7973c2f0d4.avif?t=1784800094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras_big/a7dc6fc3608d53fdf8ed0d7973c2f0d4.webp?t=1784800094 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying does not end your run. You drop into the facility's security system, where you can help your crew or mess with<br> them. Your call.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/bfe70012e57b16db5229b3b947dcdb61.poster.avif?t=1784800094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/bfe70012e57b16db5229b3b947dcdb61.webm?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/bfe70012e57b16db5229b3b947dcdb61.mp4?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/d46040e60f61755707b5b9b1371e2874.avif?t=1784800094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras_big/d46040e60f61755707b5b9b1371e2874.webp?t=1784800094 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash your Jolts in for gear and upgrades. The shopkeeper sees everything, so pay up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/f9fe50a68c8368a6ea5e2e5608f05fbe.poster.avif?t=1784800094\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/f9fe50a68c8368a6ea5e2e5608f05fbe.webm?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/f9fe50a68c8368a6ea5e2e5608f05fbe.mp4?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/dee34cfc071954de6dfdff60034b8877.avif?t=1784800094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras_big/dee34cfc071954de6dfdff60034b8877.webp?t=1784800094 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop has a casino. Bet the crew's Jolts and ride back rich, or very quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/28948f0a787eb5ce3a500ca332c61eec.poster.a