 security system: help your crew out, or make it worse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One shared wallet of Jolts: gear, upgrades, or the whole paycheck on the casino table</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph entities in the field to build a permanent codex that survives every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your chassis: colors, patches, and a glowing face that reacts to your voice</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DATA BREACH</strong> is corporate horror for 1-4 expendable robots. <strong>Valkyron</strong> leases your mind, rents you a chassis, and sends you into long abandoned facilities to recover the data that keeps its cities running. Hit today's quota and you've earned another shift. Miss it, and the whole crew gets <strong>recycled</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/44a5d8d0a1475bfac45daeb9f8da8bb5.avif?t=1784800094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras_big/44a5d8d0a1475bfac45daeb9f8da8bb5.webp?t=1784800094 width=1560 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick together, cover each other, and make the train.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/3b2f26d4496a1340b8287373758253df.poster.avif?t=1784800094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/3b2f26d4496a1340b8287373758253df.webm?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/3b2f26d4496a1340b8287373758253df.mp4?t=1784800094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_para